luscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8boroxpJYffqqgfzRg2nyx7Y4u5LLiwO28L3eAdKmr7g&oe=6A2FF6D6"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "523695041681100", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982515_1202827069876585_3787854185169420288_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lrdKDhK9DQUQ7kNvwF6QF6a&_nc_oc=Adr5xV9l9LlwKZcoFhTZEAxz1R0Wz4yjwHUbqVlJiazMFO06LSTmKQ3D1IzbInzx700&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-TdUhwE9apl4rG5TNvyanXGwR_XyVwUe8hxPK4Mx4ftg&oe=6A3003CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Creed: Rise to Glory - Demo", "keywords": ["free", "games", "best", "demo", "fun"], "long_description": "Experience the pulse-pounding excitement of boxing with the cinematic thrill of a blockbuster movie as you become Adonis Creed, fighting to establish your legacy in the ring and beyond. \n\n\u2022 Live Your Legacy: Challenge both your body and mind as you experience the ascent of Adonis Creed from undiscovered underdog to world-class fighter, all within an immersive universe inspired by the Creed\u2122 films.\n\u2022 Multiple Game Modes: Choose your path to glory in multiple game modes: story-driven Career, customizable Freeplay, or minigame-based Training.\n\u2022 Online PvP: The fight just a lot more personal. Set up custom fights with friends or find your contenders in crossplay Quick Match.\n\u2022 Feel the Impact: Phantom Melee Technology mimics the real-life effects of throwing and taking punches in the ring, such as the out-of-body sensation of getting knocked out or the strain of fatigue during a long, frantic bout.", "short_description": "Do you have what it takes to become a champion? Follow the ascent of boxer Adonis Creed as you go toe-to-toe with the world\u2019s top opponents in this intense, cinematic boxing experience. Featuring new Phantom Melee Technology for impactful VR melee combat, you\u2019ll train, fight, and win like Creed."}]}, "developer_na